        "Take the hire first.  <mark>Yam is a Patreon co-founder and its technology chief, and he is going to OpenAI to lead Creator Product.  Drew Rowny, Patreon's head of product, and Shannon Ma, its head of engineering, both stepped down in the last few weeks and are going with him.</mark>  His own words: we are going to build together with Creators at OpenAI and share early access to a new set of tools that I think will be critically valuable to Creators and their communities.  Then a pointer — pay attention to OpenAI DevDay next week.  That is Tuesday 29 September.",
